Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otlp/
https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto/tree/v1.3.2

Note: react-telemetry-open implements OTLP/HTTP JSON serialisation from
scratch, following the OpenTelemetry Protocol Specification v1.3.2.
No code from the OpenTelemetry JavaScript SDK (@opentelemetry/sdk-*) is
included in this package. The implementation covers:

  - opentelemetry-proto/.../metrics/v1/metrics.proto (Gauge metric type)
  - opentelemetry-proto/.../trace/v1/trace.proto (Span type)
  - opentelemetry-proto/.../logs/v1/logs.proto (LogRecord type)
  - opentelemetry-proto/.../common/v1/common.proto (KeyValue attributes)

Known deviations from the full specification (planned for future releases):
  - Metrics: only Gauge type implemented (Histogram planned for v1.1.0)
  - Spans: no parentSpanId — all spans are root spans (planned for v2.0.0)
  - No W3C traceparent header propagation (planned for v2.0.0)

